# Root build context: kbeads (the kbeads image), the agent image, and the coop
# images all build from here because kbeads/, coop/ and gardenio/ are siblings
# tied together by cross-module replace directives. Keep the context small.
.git
.github
.gitlab
.quench
.playwright-mcp
docs
observability
policy
usr
scripts
# ...except the go.work members under it: the agent image's go-warm stages run
# go in workspace mode over the whole context, and go refuses a go.work whose
# `use` directories are missing (gd-j2ABjjrEL0). A new go.work member under an
# ignored directory needs the same exception.
!scripts/build-dictation-corpus
!scripts/wer-eval
coop/target
coop/docs
gardenio/terraform
gardenio/helm
gardenio/docs
gardenio/plans
gardenio/grafana-plugins
gardenio/tests
gardenio/images/*
!gardenio/images/agent
